                <mxCell id="stack" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" value="Docker Compose local (docker-compose.local.yml) — 7 service&#xa;A: DB → incident-missing-db · BFF downstream / gateway cluster → incident-missing-host&#xa;B: gateway ReverseProxy…MaxConnectionsPerServer=1&#xa;C: request X-Chaos-Fault: 5xx vào cổng đích (middleware 027), tỷ lệ 5–50%" vertex="1">
